  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Element Black delivers the signature comfort, feel and reduced-vibration response of the Element family in a distinctive black colorway. Built with Multi-Mono Technology, it is designed for players with long, fast swings who want polyester control without the harsh response associated with firmer strings. The 1.28 mm gauge sits between the standard 1.25 and 1.30 Element gauges, offering a balanced blend of feel, control, stability and durability.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Element Black 在 Element 系列标志性的柔和、舒适和低震动击球体验基础上，加入黑色外观。它采用 Multi-Mono Technology，适合挥拍幅度大、速度快，同时又不喜欢传统硬质聚酯生硬手感的球员。1.28毫米线径介于标准 Element 1.25 与 1.30 之间，在手感、控制、稳定性和耐久性之间取得更均衡的表现。"
  },

